  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NHO Cooperation programme 2020-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A programme that aims to strengthen Employers&apos; Organisations in Ethiopia, Ghana, Kenya, Tanzania, Tunisia, Uganda and Vietnam, using technical support from the Confederation of Norwegian Enterprise (NHO). The programme covers the following five thematic areas: 1) Organisational development, 2) Social dialogue, 3) Gender equality, 4) Vocational training, and 5) Doing responsible business in Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
